@host = https://localhost:7043

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Clinic contact details (public)
GET {{host}}/api/clinic

### Log in as admin (copy the token into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@clinicflow.com", "password": "your-admin-password" }

###
@token = paste-token-here

### Pending appointments
GET {{host}}/api/appointments?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Doctors
GET {{host}}/api/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
